<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-Guardian raised at Salomon.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Guardian raised at Salomon.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Guardian Royal Exchange Plc was raised to a &quot;buy&quot; from a &quot;hold&quot; at Salomon Brothers, analyst Trevor May at the brokerage said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>May set a price target of 305p on the stock and said it had been trading at a 12 percent discount to net asset value, which was too high.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom, +44 171 542 5106</p>
